{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"39":{"eng-name":"Battles (Kitab Al-Malahim)","ara-name":"كتاب الملاحم"}},"section_detail":{"39":{"hadithnumber_first":4291,"hadithnumber_last":4350,"arabicnumber_first":4291,"arabicnumber_last":4350}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4303,"arabicnumber":4303,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Huraira رضي الله عنه : Le Prophète ﷺ a dit : « L’Heure ne viendra pas avant que les musulmans ne combattent les Turcs, un peuple dont les visages ressemblent à des boucliers recouverts de peau et qui portent des sandales en poil. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (2912)"}],"reference":{"book":39,"hadith":13},"chapter":{"id":9,"ara-name":"باب فِي قِتَالِ التُّرْكِ","eng-name":"Regarding fighting the Turks","isFirstHadith":true}}]}